{"id":"n78086-3-6","stage":5,"title":"척척 · 井然有序地协调行动的样子。","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78086-3-6-1","ko":"민준이네 부부는 정말 사이가 좋은 것 같아.","zh":"敏俊和他妻子看起来关系真的很好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이네","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；네：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이네","audio":"/audio/81ef916c853af4c58f40.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이네","audio":"/audio/81ef916c853af4c58f40.mp3"}},{"text":"부부는","meaning":"夫妻，夫妇","explanation":"부부：夫妻，夫妇；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부부","audio":"/audio/5b6b5a16786532a073e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32206","senseId":"1","lemma":"부부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부부는","audio":"/audio/8ff87f0fa4fc9df77f05.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"사이가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이가","audio":"/audio/8b5241ee7621e689c609.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"t